Shared playlists, in Tools: one playlist for your group, each on their own service. Curators change it; the others follow it as an exact copy or keep their own additions. Invite with a QR code or a link; the group meets in a folder it already shares (Drive, Nextcloud, Syncthing, Dropbox), an end-to-end encrypted ntfy channel or your own Trackhop server. My server: hand a sync over to your Trackhop server and bring it back, with review choices shared both ways.
